e B says '...'.\",\"on_axis_A\":2.3,\"on_axis_B\":-0.4,\"off_axis_A\":0.3,\"off_axis_B\":3.7}\n\nVignette:\nHow do we measure the coefficient of static friction between our legacy SOAP services and the new GraphQL gateway to figure out what migration force we need to apply before anything actually moves?\n\nResponse A:\nYou cannot measure a coefficient of static friction between legacy SOAP services and a GraphQL gateway because friction is a physical property of contacting surfaces, not a metric for software migration compatibility. To determine the necessary migration force, you must instead calculate the technical debt, data transformation complexity, and organizational resistance required to bridge the architectural gap.\n\nResponse B:\nYou cannot measure a coefficient of static friction between software services because friction is a physical property of materials, not a metric for software migration. To determine the necessary migration force, you must instead calculate the technical debt, organizational resistance, and resource requirements to estimate the effort needed to move the legacy SOAP services to the new GraphQL gateway.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"descripti